# Week 1: Authentication & User Management

## Overview

Welcome to **BizCore ERP**, a modern Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) system designed for Small and Medium Enterprises (SMEs). Throughout this internship, you will build this application module by module, learning industry-standard software development practices and modern full-stack technologies.

This week's objective is to build a secure authentication and user management system that will serve as the foundation for the rest of the application.

---

# Learning Objectives

By the end of this task, you should understand:

- Project architecture
- Git workflow
- REST API principles
- Authentication
- Authorization
- Password hashing
- JWT Authentication
- Refresh Tokens
- Protected Routes
- Form Validation
- Error Handling
- Clean Code Principles
- Environment Variables
- Database Design with Prisma
- API Documentation

---

