# Task Objectives

Build a complete authentication system for BizCore ERP.

The application should allow users to:

- Register
- Login
- Logout
- Verify Email
- Reset Password
- Change Password
- Update Profile
- Refresh Access Token

---

# Functional Requirements

## 1. User Registration

Create a registration page.

Fields

- First Name
- Last Name
- Email
- Phone Number
- Password
- Confirm Password

Requirements

- Validate every field
- Password minimum 8 characters
- Password must contain:
  - Uppercase
  - Lowercase
  - Number
  - Special Character
- Email must be unique
- Password must be hashed

---

## 2. Email Verification

After registration

- Generate verification token
- Send verification email
- User cannot login until email is verified

---

## 3. Login

User logs in using

- Email
- Password

If successful

Return

- Access Token
- Refresh Token
- User Information

---

## 4. Refresh Token

Implement refresh token endpoint.

When the access token expires

Generate a new one without forcing the user to login again.

---

## 5. Forgot Password

User enters email.

Generate reset token.

Send reset email.

---

## 6. Reset Password

Allow user to create a new password.

Requirements

- Token validation
- Password validation

---

## 7. User Profile

Authenticated users can

- View profile
- Edit profile
- Upload profile picture (optional)

---

## 8. Change Password

Require

- Old Password
- New Password
- Confirm Password

---

## 9. Logout

Invalidate refresh token.

---

# Authorization

Create middleware for

- Authentication
- Authorization

Roles

```
SUPER_ADMIN

ADMIN

MANAGER

EMPLOYEE
```

Only authenticated users should access protected routes.

---

# Database Design

Create the following model.

```
User

id
firstName
lastName
email
phone
password
role
isVerified
verificationToken
resetPasswordToken
resetPasswordExpires
refreshToken
profileImage
createdAt
updatedAt
```

Use Prisma ORM.

---

# API Endpoints

## Authentication

```
POST /api/auth/register

POST /api/auth/login

POST /api/auth/logout

POST /api/auth/refresh

POST /api/auth/forgot-password

POST /api/auth/reset-password

GET /api/auth/verify-email
```

---

## User

```
GET /api/users/profile

PATCH /api/users/profile

PATCH /api/users/change-password
```

---

# Validation

Validate every request.

Examples

- Required fields
- Email format
- Password strength
- Duplicate email
- Invalid tokens

Return meaningful error messages.

---

# Security Requirements

- Hash passwords using bcrypt
- Store secrets in .env
- Never expose passwords
- Protect private routes
- Use HTTP-only cookies for refresh tokens (preferred)
- Implement rate limiting on authentication endpoints
- Enable CORS appropriately
- Use Helmet middleware
- Sanitize incoming data

---

